1710:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param interrupt_node Node pointer representing the transmit FIFO events. \n
1711:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 						  \b Range: @ref XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_INTERRUPT_NODE_POINTER_STANDARD,
1712:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 						  			@ref XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_INTERRUPT_NODE_POINTER_ALTERNATE
1713:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param service_request The service request to be used for interrupt generation. \n
1714:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 						  \b Range: 0 to 5.
1715:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
1716:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1717:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
1718:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Sets an interrupt node for the transmit FIFO events.\n\n
1719:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * A node pointer represents one or more interrupt events. Service request represents the interrupt
1720:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * among the 6 interrupt nodes available for USIC module.
1721:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * API configures the service request to be used for interrupt generation for the events selected.
1722:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * A transmit FIFO event can generate an interrupt only if the interrupt node is configured for the
1723:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * the interrupt generation is enabled for the event. For example, transmit FIFO standard transmit 
1724:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * interrupt is generated if the interrupt node for the same is set and interrupt is enabled.<br>
1725:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1726:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Note: NVIC node should be explicitly enabled for the interrupt generation.
1727:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1728:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Related APIs:</b><BR>
1729:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_EnableEvent() \n\n\n
1730:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  */
