1964:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Receive FIFO is the subset of a common FIFO sized 64 words. This FIFO is shared between 2 channe
