1967:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Since the FIFO is shared between 2 USIC channels, FIFO size should be carefully selected. A FIFO
