2028:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Event bitmasks can be constructed using the enumeration @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT_CONF_t.
2029:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Multiple events can be enabled by providing multiple events in a single call. For providing
2030:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * multiple events, combine the events using bitwise OR operation.<br>
