2071:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 					\b Range: @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_INTERRUPT_NODE_POINTER_STANDARD,
2072:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 					@ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_INTERRUPT_NODE_POINTER_ALTERNATE
2073:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param service_request The service request to be used for interrupt generation.\n
2074:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 					\b Range: 0 to 5.
