2141:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * When the receive FIFO filling level reaches the configured size, FIFO full flag is set.
2142:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/XMC/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Any data received when the receive FIFO is full, is lost.
